{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "579ec12e-214f-8bd7-ac7e-b3a41c719cee",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T10:15:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:09:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Odete Gomes, G-O-M-E-S. I'm calling about a catch basin at the corner near my house. I'm at 169 Pelham Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Gomes, 169 Pelham Street. What's it doing, the catch basin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's clogged. Packed with leaves. It's been that way since before the holidays. I noticed it the week before Christmas, so, the twentieth or the twenty-first, I'd have to say the twenty-first. And there's a puddle at the corner that never drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Never drains, even when it's dry out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. No rain at all this week. It hasn't rained since, um, Monday, and that was only a sprinkle. The puddle is the same size today as it was Tuesday. At night it freezes, and then it's a sheet of ice across the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:10:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. So the water just sits there and the drain's blocked on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. You can see the grate, but it's covered with a mat of wet leaves. Nobody has cleared it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Which corner is it? Is it Pelham and a cross street, or right in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at the corner just below my house, on the downhill side, so the water collects against the curb there. It's about, I'd say, forty feet from my front steps. Not directly in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, downhill corner from 169, about forty feet. I'll put that in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And one more thing. I have a neighbor, an older gentleman, next door. He can't get out when it's icy like that. He uses a walker. He's stayed in since the ice came on Tuesday, and I've been bringing him his groceries."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:11:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, that's worth noting. I'll mark that there's an elderly resident nearby with mobility trouble, so they know it's more than a nuisance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. I'd appreciate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Anything else you can tell me, like is it just that one basin or others on the street too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that one that I know of. The one at the top of the street is fine. I walk past it every morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask something? Is that a city drain or a state one? Because I wasn't sure who to call. Somebody told me some of the drains belong to the state."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. On a residential street like Pelham, it's normally a city drain, and that would be us. The state ones are usually along the state roads. If it turns out to be one of theirs, we'd pass it along to them ourselves, you wouldn't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's a relief, I'd rather not make three phone calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, understood. Let me read this back. A catch basin at the downhill corner below 169 Pelham Street, clogged with leaves since around December twenty-first, standing water that doesn't drain, freezing at night, and an older neighbor with a walker who can't get out. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Except the walker, I should say, I'm not certain it's a walker or a cane. I've seen both. Let's say he has trouble walking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trouble walking. I'll change that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I like to be accurate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:13:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate that, it makes it easier on the crew. Do you want a call back when it's been looked at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be good. The number is 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine. That's the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's my landline. I'm home most of the day, so if I don't pick up at first, I may be in the other room. Let it ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. I'll put that on the work order. It goes to the drainage crew, and with it dry out they should be able to get to it without too much trouble. I'd say give it a few working days, and if it's still sitting there next Friday, call back and mention this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:14:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next Friday, the thirteenth. Alright. I'll make a note of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. In the meantime, if you can, maybe put some sand or salt down at that corner for your neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have some rock salt. I'll do that this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Gomes. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:15:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
